  "docstring": "Suppose that $A + A$ contains the first $n$ squares. Is $|A| \\geq n^{1 - o(1)}$?\n\nIt is known that necessarily $|A| \\geq n^{2/3 - o(1)}$, whilst in the other direction there do\nexist such $A$ with $|A| \\ll_C n / \\log^C n$ for any $C$.\n",
